title: "Δmension Mathematical Universe"
message: "If you use this software or API in your research or project, please cite it using this metadata."
type: software
version: "2.0.0"
date-released: "2026-06-03"
url: "https://d-dmension-mathematical-universe-uuon-foundation.replit.app"
repository-code: "https://github.com/uuonnouu/dmension-"
abstract: >
  Δmension is a REST API and interactive 3D explorer providing 2,650+ mathematically
  exact parametric shapes across 151+ categories — topology, quantum mechanics, general
  relativity, DNA molecular structures, IFS fractals, and non-Euclidean geometry.
  Each shape is defined by real parametric equations with 26 live parameters (A–Z)
  and exports 3D vertex data (positions, normals, UVs, indices) ready for Three.js,
  Unity, Unreal Engine, WebGL, and machine learning pipelines.
